                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "FAR Lone Sails is a beautiful little masterpiece. \n\nThere’s something truly special about this game. The atmosphere, beautiful visuals, peaceful soundtrack, and unique journey make every moment memorable.\n\nTravelling across a mysterious abandoned world in your little vehicle feels strangely relaxing yet emotional. The game tells its story without needing many words and honestly that makes it even more special.\n\nSometimes the best adventures aren't about fighting enemies or saving the world. They are  simply about enjoying the journey.\n\nA short but unforgettable experience. Highly recommended 10/10",
